(7165985, 1100147, 86447, '<td valign="top">This is the best shot that you think you took all year... the best shot that you want to show your friends that you took in a year?<br/> <br/>I really want you to tell me why this means so much to you.<br/> <br/>I''m not kidding.  I want to understand what you see in this so I can see it, too.<br/> <br/>Please feel free to message me with your reply. <br/> <br/>I want to love this as much as you do.</td>', 'This is the best shot that you think you took all year... the best shot that you want to show your friends that you took in a year? I really want you to tell me why this means so much to you. I''m not kidding.  I want to understand what you see in this so I can see it, too. Please feel free to message me with your reply.  I want to love this as much as you do.', '2014-01-31 00:22:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7165988, 1100800, 108069, '<td valign="top">If there were ever a great time to use a fisheye this is it. Awesome. Great title as well, as that''s what I love about the national parks: the colors. You have to see it to believe it. Thanks for this.</td>', 'If there were ever a great time to use a fisheye this is it. Awesome. Great title as well, as that''s what I love about the national parks: the colors. You have to see it to believe it. Thanks for this.', '2014-01-31 00:23:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7165989, 1099047, 86447, '<td valign="top">I love the pose!   I wish, though, that the focus were spot on his eyes... instead of his clothes.<br/>His face seems to be not as "in focus" as his knee or his suspenders.</td>', 'I love the pose!   I wish, though, that the focus were spot on his eyes... instead of his clothes.His face seems to be not as "in focus" as his knee or his suspenders.', '2014-01-31 00:24:36.000000', NULL, 1),
