(7166352, 1099057, 19944, '<td valign="top">Is this from the walkway above I35 near 24th Street?  My daughter lived in the Fair Oaks apartments on Clinton Ave. until this past May.  She works at Target corporate.<br/> <br/>I really like the star bursts of the lights.</td>', 'Is this from the walkway above I35 near 24th Street?  My daughter lived in the Fair Oaks apartments on Clinton Ave. until this past May.  She works at Target corporate. I really like the star bursts of the lights.', '2014-01-31 13:52:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7166390, 1099927, 144365, '<td valign="top">The first guy sitting down needs to have his face brighter. The combo of both their expressions would make this stronger.</td>', 'The first guy sitting down needs to have his face brighter. The combo of both their expressions would make this stronger.', '2014-01-31 15:13:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7166405, 1100755, 144365, '<td valign="top">If the owl was facing the camera this would be a contender. That slight bend of the head detracts from the image without a context explaining why. <br/> <br/>I see the branch, but branches are boring. A scuttling mouse or something would have been an insane photo.</td>', 'If the owl was facing the camera this would be a contender. That slight bend of the head detracts from the image without a context explaining why.  I see the branch, but branches are boring. A scuttling mouse or something would have been an insane photo.', '2014-01-31 15:24:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7166412, 1099762, 144365, '<td valign="top">I like this photo, but hate the title. <br/>Momentum = mass * velocity. <br/>There''s nothing moving in this photo. I can''t divorce the title from the image. Sorry.</td>', 'I like this photo, but hate the title. Momentum = mass * velocity. There''s nothing moving in this photo. I can''t divorce the title from the image. Sorry.', '2014-01-31 15:33:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7166440, 1098849, 57447, '<td valign="top">Great energy here!</td>', 'Great energy here!', '2014-01-31 16:14:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7166451, 1100268, 32011, '<td valign="top">This would have been a GREAT image had you <br/>(a) not lost the toes of the girl in the iddle<br/>(b) processed it in B&amp;W<br/>(c) gotten a little lower to take the shot.<br/>This scene had enormous potential, and you''ve shown that you have the eye for great situation portraits, or street photography, but there just a few elements that will hurt this image with the general voting public... I do expect you''ll probably get some better marks from some quarters of the DPC community though.  <br/>So... what am I going to give it... initially, I was thinking a 5 or 6... but looking at it from a different perspective, had you done all those things above, I reckon I''d be giving it a 10, so, I''m thinking somewhere between... so, you''re getting an 8 from me.</td>', 'This would have been a GREAT image had you (a) not lost the toes of the girl in the iddle(b) processed it in B&W(c) gotten a little lower to take the shot.This scene had enormous potential, and you''ve shown that you have the eye for great situation portraits, or street photography, but there just a few elements that will hurt this image with the general voting public... I do expect you''ll probably get some better marks from some quarters of the DPC community though.  So... what am I going to give it... initially, I was thinking a 5 or 6... but looking at it from a different perspective, had you done all those things above, I reckon I''d be giving it a 10, so, I''m thinking somewhere between... so, you''re getting an 8 from me.', '2014-01-31 16:50:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7166469, 1099193, 12076, '<td valign="top">I rated this highly because it has plenty of emotion.  I think it would be even stronger if cropped in a bit.  Nice work.</td>', 'I rated this highly because it has plenty of emotion.  I think it would be even stronger if cropped in a bit.  Nice work.', '2014-01-31 17:20:43.000000', NULL, 1),
