(7166699, 1099696, 30861, '<td valign="top">"Sacred to the memory of Julia Pfeiffer Burns, a true pioneer..." I used to live not that far up the road from this place. It''s one of my favorite views in the world. Though I always tried to keep the palm tree out of it, it seems so anomalous :-)</td>', '"Sacred to the memory of Julia Pfeiffer Burns, a true pioneer..." I used to live not that far up the road from this place. It''s one of my favorite views in the world. Though I always tried to keep the palm tree out of it, it seems so anomalous :-)', '2014-01-31 23:26:27.000000', NULL, 1),
