(7168238, 1099761, 30982, '<td valign="top">That tongue is impossibly long, but then so are the legs of the gentleman in the same color combination.  I suspect they''re related.</td>', 'That tongue is impossibly long, but then so are the legs of the gentleman in the same color combination.  I suspect they''re related.', '2014-02-02 21:53:43.000000', NULL, 1),
