(7170882, 1100628, 144365, '<td valign="top">When I first saw this entry, I completely dismissed it. In my second pass through I realized how ridiculously good it is. The only problem, there''s another image that I think is vastly superior to every other entry in this challenge, so I awarded this with an eight (gave no nines this challenge). <br/> <br/>It''s weird, this isn''t anything I''d ever hang on my wall, or even get printed, but it awesomeness level is up there.</td>', 'When I first saw this entry, I completely dismissed it. In my second pass through I realized how ridiculously good it is. The only problem, there''s another image that I think is vastly superior to every other entry in this challenge, so I awarded this with an eight (gave no nines this challenge).  It''s weird, this isn''t anything I''d ever hang on my wall, or even get printed, but it awesomeness level is up there.', '2014-02-06 13:15:58.000000', NULL, 1),
