(7171128, 1098849, 12076, '<td valign="top">Very nice!  I can really feel the movement.  Has a dreamy or flashback effect on me.  I  really can''t explain why but I like it very much.</td>', 'Very nice!  I can really feel the movement.  Has a dreamy or flashback effect on me.  I  really can''t explain why but I like it very much.', '2014-02-06 18:29:34.000000', NULL, 1),
