(7171131, 1099478, 12076, '<td valign="top">I don''t like photos of animals in zoos, generally.  But this one seems to be a commentary on the rest of us.  Something like that.  8.</td>', 'I don''t like photos of animals in zoos, generally.  But this one seems to be a commentary on the rest of us.  Something like that.  8.', '2014-02-06 18:30:56.000000', NULL, 1),
