(7171134, 1099490, 12076, '<td valign="top">I like it a lot.  I can imagine being there in the damp and cool night air.  Has an old filmy look to it too.  I kinda wish the cycler wasn''t smack in the middle vertically like he is.   No matter...  8</td>', 'I like it a lot.  I can imagine being there in the damp and cool night air.  Has an old filmy look to it too.  I kinda wish the cycler wasn''t smack in the middle vertically like he is.   No matter...  8', '2014-02-06 18:33:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7171135, 1100628, 12076, '<td valign="top">This one makes me smile!  And that''s worth another bump..</td>', 'This one makes me smile!  And that''s worth another bump..', '2014-02-06 18:34:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7171136, 1100153, 12076, '<td valign="top">Incredible location!  Great shot too...</td>', 'Incredible location!  Great shot too...', '2014-02-06 18:35:28.000000', NULL, 1),
