(7171523, 1099144, 174483, '<td valign="top">Technically spot on, tonality is very natural and real. The warm tones of her skin and stunning hair contrast nicely with the coolness of the sprinkling of snow. My only criticism is that this feels like it wants to be a "narrative" image and even if I''m not allowed to see what she sees, I wish my eye had a little more negative space to her right (viewer''s left) to flow into. I love square cropped images but I think this one might be a little better with a wider ratio.</td>', 'Technically spot on, tonality is very natural and real. The warm tones of her skin and stunning hair contrast nicely with the coolness of the sprinkling of snow. My only criticism is that this feels like it wants to be a "narrative" image and even if I''m not allowed to see what she sees, I wish my eye had a little more negative space to her right (viewer''s left) to flow into. I love square cropped images but I think this one might be a little better with a wider ratio.', '2014-02-06 23:12:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7171525, 1099463, 114285, '<td valign="top">So you think you''re a hot shot eh!<br/> <br/>8</td>', 'So you think you''re a hot shot eh! 8', '2014-02-06 23:13:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7171527, 1099588, 174483, '<td valign="top">Good eye for finding a photogenic scene. Watch out for the halo effect between your roofs and trees and the sky. Also, watch out for perspective issues, especially near the edges where it''s more obvious that lines that should be vertical aren''t quite there.</td>', 'Good eye for finding a photogenic scene. Watch out for the halo effect between your roofs and trees and the sky. Also, watch out for perspective issues, especially near the edges where it''s more obvious that lines that should be vertical aren''t quite there.', '2014-02-06 23:15:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7171533, 1100351, 174483, '<td valign="top">The hummer seems a tad soft and possibly a stop underexposed. I might also shift a little more negative space to the right to keep it from being so dead center.</td>', 'The hummer seems a tad soft and possibly a stop underexposed. I might also shift a little more negative space to the right to keep it from being so dead center.', '2014-02-06 23:20:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7171535, 1100821, 174483, '<td valign="top">Superb B&amp;W street shot! Bravo!</td>', 'Superb B&W street shot! Bravo!', '2014-02-06 23:20:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7171538, 1100731, 174483, '<td valign="top">You broke the rule! clocks and watches must (MUST) be set to 10:10 when being photographed!<br/> <br/>That was total sarcasm.... For the record, though, if you ever see a watch in an ad in a magazine or billboard they''re always set to 10:10.<br/> <br/>Technically, the image is flawless. My brain does seem to want 12:00 to be at the top of the image though. Seeing it sideways just makes me want to lean my head to the left to see it "correctly"</td>', 'You broke the rule! clocks and watches must (MUST) be set to 10:10 when being photographed! That was total sarcasm.... For the record, though, if you ever see a watch in an ad in a magazine or billboard they''re always set to 10:10. Technically, the image is flawless. My brain does seem to want 12:00 to be at the top of the image though. Seeing it sideways just makes me want to lean my head to the left to see it "correctly"', '2014-02-06 23:26:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7171539, 1100306, 174483, '<td valign="top">You have three flowers as your focal point and that does play to the "in threes" rule. I do wish the center one was the brightest, though. Or that it was at least as bright as the one to the left.</td>', 'You have three flowers as your focal point and that does play to the "in threes" rule. I do wish the center one was the brightest, though. Or that it was at least as bright as the one to the left.', '2014-02-06 23:27:25.000000', NULL, 1),
