(7171545, 1100607, 174483, '<td valign="top">It may be the wine I''ve had tonight but it looks like your picture is crooked - leaning down to the right. I think the overall composition might also be improved by moving the horizon up or down and making the person or the storm the main focus. The two elements works well against each other but they''re too "even" to me as it stands. If that makes any sense at all.</td>', 'It may be the wine I''ve had tonight but it looks like your picture is crooked - leaning down to the right. I think the overall composition might also be improved by moving the horizon up or down and making the person or the storm the main focus. The two elements works well against each other but they''re too "even" to me as it stands. If that makes any sense at all.', '2014-02-06 23:29:37.000000', NULL, 1),
