(7171563, 1099593, 174483, '<td valign="top">I like the concept of framing the fall colors and the cabin and trailer with the trees in the foreground but I think it falls a little short of being a great shot.The cabin and the trailer have a lot of interest so I wish I could see them better. Also, that stump between me and the trailer is a distraction. If you have another shot from this scene where you were standing where that stump is and have the same cabin and trailer a little larger in the frame with the same bright trees off to the left.... that''s the shot I''d like to see.</td>', 'I like the concept of framing the fall colors and the cabin and trailer with the trees in the foreground but I think it falls a little short of being a great shot.The cabin and the trailer have a lot of interest so I wish I could see them better. Also, that stump between me and the trailer is a distraction. If you have another shot from this scene where you were standing where that stump is and have the same cabin and trailer a little larger in the frame with the same bright trees off to the left.... that''s the shot I''d like to see.', '2014-02-06 23:33:14.000000', NULL, 1),
