(7171570, 1099758, 174483, '<td valign="top">Love the gritty detail here. Upon first glance I had no idea what I was looking at and in an abstract kind of way I thought of shipping containers or barges bumping up against each other. My brain and eye caught up and I see that it''s walls and a window and a broom... All in all a great shot with lots of visual stuff to chew on. Well done.</td>', 'Love the gritty detail here. Upon first glance I had no idea what I was looking at and in an abstract kind of way I thought of shipping containers or barges bumping up against each other. My brain and eye caught up and I see that it''s walls and a window and a broom... All in all a great shot with lots of visual stuff to chew on. Well done.', '2014-02-06 23:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
