(7171595, 1099808, 174483, '<td valign="top">Beautiful silhouette shot and great storytelling! The only gripe (and it''s minor) is to watch out for digital banding in the red/orange tones coming off the sun. I''ve shot scenes like this and trust me I know what a pain it is to get the gradations just right.... it''s a home run when you can nail it, though.</td>', 'Beautiful silhouette shot and great storytelling! The only gripe (and it''s minor) is to watch out for digital banding in the red/orange tones coming off the sun. I''ve shot scenes like this and trust me I know what a pain it is to get the gradations just right.... it''s a home run when you can nail it, though.', '2014-02-06 23:40:48.000000', NULL, 1),
