(7171840, 1100268, 102278, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by vlado:</b></div><hr/><i> Now I feel silly... ME having given YOU tips on how to improve a photo.  Well done on a great photo. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Ha! Nonsense! I completely agree with a couple of your points - a bit of a lower perspective to include a bit more toes would have been great. One of those things i guess - a split second later and one of the girls would have moved.  Not sure about the black and white though  i wouldn''t want to lose all that lovely orange.</td>', 'Originally posted by vlado: Now I feel silly... ME having given YOU tips on how to improve a photo.  Well done on a great photo.   Ha! Nonsense! I completely agree with a couple of your points - a bit of a lower perspective to include a bit more toes would have been great. One of those things i guess - a split second later and one of the girls would have moved.  Not sure about the black and white though  i wouldn''t want to lose all that lovely orange.', '2014-02-07 06:40:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(7171843, 1100152, 65234, '<td valign="top">A bit underrated, IMO.  I know I''m always thrilled to get a recognizable shot of a bug in flight!  Accidentally or otherwise LOL.  The little shadow here really makes the shot for me, and I like the implied diagonal to the composition.  Maybe you could have hand-sharpened the bee a tad to improve the score, but I think this deserved a higher score than it got, if only for the difficulty factor.</td>', 'A bit underrated, IMO.  I know I''m always thrilled to get a recognizable shot of a bug in flight!  Accidentally or otherwise LOL.  The little shadow here really makes the shot for me, and I like the implied diagonal to the composition.  Maybe you could have hand-sharpened the bee a tad to improve the score, but I think this deserved a higher score than it got, if only for the difficulty factor.', '2014-02-07 06:50:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(7171845, 1099384, 68020, '<td valign="top">Yeah Doc!!!! Way to go buddy!!! Love this picture and it so well deserving of the blue ribbon!</td>', 'Yeah Doc!!!! Way to go buddy!!! Love this picture and it so well deserving of the blue ribbon!', '2014-02-07 06:53:08.000000', NULL, 0),
