(7171873, 1100268, 76335, '<td valign="top">No, no. The cropped legs are necessary. They become triangles, they go on forever. Of course, I might feel differently if I had neer seen it that way. The color is also necessary. It brings it to life. It''s the kind of shot that makes me wonder why I bother.</td>', 'No, no. The cropped legs are necessary. They become triangles, they go on forever. Of course, I might feel differently if I had neer seen it that way. The color is also necessary. It brings it to life. It''s the kind of shot that makes me wonder why I bother.', '2014-02-07 08:00:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(7171878, 1099384, 92577, '<td valign="top">Truly awesome image and adventure.</td>', 'Truly awesome image and adventure.', '2014-02-07 08:20:29.000000', NULL, 0),
