(7171901, 1100825, 86218, '<td valign="top">Art Shot and why do I also see this hanging on a wall.. time to join the art crowd there in Clarens and sell some canvasses to the wealthy Johburgers flying through the Galleries. In no time you will tell Bees to deliver not only magazines but art pieces in Gauteng.. It is TIME... Well done Amanda. PS - it could be just my monitor but i would increase the blacks on this slightly. Also bring out the layers hinted in the back slightly more. It''s truly beautiful with subtle lines<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2014-02-07 08:58:30.</i></td>', 'Art Shot and why do I also see this hanging on a wall.. time to join the art crowd there in Clarens and sell some canvasses to the wealthy Johburgers flying through the Galleries. In no time you will tell Bees to deliver not only magazines but art pieces in Gauteng.. It is TIME... Well done Amanda. PS - it could be just my monitor but i would increase the blacks on this slightly. Also bring out the layers hinted in the back slightly more. It''s truly beautiful with subtle lines', '2014-02-07 08:56:46.000000', '2014-02-07 08:58:30.000000', 0),
