(7172010, 1098766, 144365, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by hahn23:</b></div><hr/><i>If people thought it was a duplicate entry, then they should have reported the image, but then voted on it as if it was legal. (It''s legal!)</i></td></tr></table>I didn''t think it was a duplicate entry. I knew it was legal because there are slight differences and the editing is different. Because I''ve seen this image before and remembered it, I gave it a vote four less than the original. From my perspective, it was lazy. <br/> <br/>I''m only trying to answer the statement you made in your comments.</td>', 'Originally posted by hahn23:If people thought it was a duplicate entry, then they should have reported the image, but then voted on it as if it was legal. (It''s legal!)I didn''t think it was a duplicate entry. I knew it was legal because there are slight differences and the editing is different. Because I''ve seen this image before and remembered it, I gave it a vote four less than the original. From my perspective, it was lazy.  I''m only trying to answer the statement you made in your comments.', '2014-02-07 11:18:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(7172011, 1100209, 12611, '<td valign="top">Wonderful shot Alice, this has all the beauty of a painting, and the realism of color of photography. would make a terrific print.</td>', 'Wonderful shot Alice, this has all the beauty of a painting, and the realism of color of photography. would make a terrific print.', '2014-02-07 11:19:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(7172013, 1100571, 12611, '<td valign="top">Great drama in this shot. like MaryO said, makes you wonder why?</td>', 'Great drama in this shot. like MaryO said, makes you wonder why?', '2014-02-07 11:20:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(7172014, 1098760, 118154, '<td valign="top">This is way better than the position suggests.</td>', 'This is way better than the position suggests.', '2014-02-07 11:20:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(7172015, 1100637, 12611, '<td valign="top">Perfect expression, nicely high key- great shot.</td>', 'Perfect expression, nicely high key- great shot.', '2014-02-07 11:21:28.000000', NULL, 0),
