(7172019, 1100718, 12611, '<td valign="top">Excellent work. the processing is great, the vignette, keeping the viewer focused where the eye does not want to be, on the business end of the wave.</td>', 'Excellent work. the processing is great, the vignette, keeping the viewer focused where the eye does not want to be, on the business end of the wave.', '2014-02-07 11:27:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(7172020, 1099593, 12611, '<td valign="top">some great elements sweep into the frame, and some beautiful interplay of birch and yellow foliage.</td>', 'some great elements sweep into the frame, and some beautiful interplay of birch and yellow foliage.', '2014-02-07 11:28:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(7172022, 1099761, 12611, '<td valign="top">So great. I like the choice to keep it in color. as well. So much detail in the dog and in the green trees...</td>', 'So great. I like the choice to keep it in color. as well. So much detail in the dog and in the green trees...', '2014-02-07 11:29:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(7172023, 1100790, 12611, '<td valign="top">Beautiful Ken.</td>', 'Beautiful Ken.', '2014-02-07 11:30:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(7172024, 1099732, 12611, '<td valign="top">Odd shaped shots never do well- so I commend you for the crop.<br/> <br/>I think this all works extremely well to transfer what it must have been like to be there, to feel the sun, see the water drip.</td>', 'Odd shaped shots never do well- so I commend you for the crop. I think this all works extremely well to transfer what it must have been like to be there, to feel the sun, see the water drip.', '2014-02-07 11:32:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(7172026, 1100757, 12611, '<td valign="top">You''ve got it all in this shot, the personal, the objective, animal nature, human nature, it all fades into cyanotype textured goodness...</td>', 'You''ve got it all in this shot, the personal, the objective, animal nature, human nature, it all fades into cyanotype textured goodness...', '2014-02-07 11:36:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(7172027, 1099711, 12611, '<td valign="top">Great randomness. You may have encapsulated the american dream, a beer, a dog, the beach, some cleavage, a sunny day... Viva La Snapshot!</td>', 'Great randomness. You may have encapsulated the american dream, a beer, a dog, the beach, some cleavage, a sunny day... Viva La Snapshot!', '2014-02-07 11:39:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(7172029, 1099920, 70270, '<td valign="top">really?  202nd place?  This one should have done much better.  I think that black spot of sensor dust or dead pixels in the middle might have taken you down a little and the foreground looks a little shaky, but that waterfall is fantastic!</td>', 'really?  202nd place?  This one should have done much better.  I think that black spot of sensor dust or dead pixels in the middle might have taken you down a little and the foreground looks a little shaky, but that waterfall is fantastic!', '2014-02-07 11:40:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(7172032, 1099920, 77188, '<td valign="top">Thanks!  I''m glad you liked it (though, truth to tell the trip was so awesome in itself that I wouldn''t even have minded to end up last).<br/> <br/>If you''re referring to the circular black thing, then it''s actually a rock or something in the waterfall (I compared to the photos I took from other angles, just to make sure).  I can agree that it doesn''t look very nice though...<br/> <br/>The foreground is indeed shaky.</td>', 'Thanks!  I''m glad you liked it (though, truth to tell the trip was so awesome in itself that I wouldn''t even have minded to end up last). If you''re referring to the circular black thing, then it''s actually a rock or something in the waterfall (I compared to the photos I took from other angles, just to make sure).  I can agree that it doesn''t look very nice though... The foreground is indeed shaky.', '2014-02-07 11:49:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(7172047, 1099003, 138253, '<td valign="top">And a new PB for you as well, you can''t ask for much more than this! :-)</td>', 'And a new PB for you as well, you can''t ask for much more than this! :-)', '2014-02-07 12:21:37.000000', NULL, 0),
