(7173125, 1100622, 18197, '<td valign="top">I am a sucker for aircraft photos. For its genre, it is as close to perfect as you can get. The props are blurred just the right amount, The plane is well focused. (Think about the balancing act that blurs the props but keeps the plane clean and sharp). The background clouds make this dramatic. Very well done, my friend.</td>', 'I am a sucker for aircraft photos. For its genre, it is as close to perfect as you can get. The props are blurred just the right amount, The plane is well focused. (Think about the balancing act that blurs the props but keeps the plane clean and sharp). The background clouds make this dramatic. Very well done, my friend.', '2014-02-08 16:03:18.000000', NULL, 0),
