(7173345, 1099712, 53572, '<td valign="top"><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=657243" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/53572/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_657243.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/53572/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_657243.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/53572/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_657243.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/>I thought I did this. I''m sure I left a lovely comment, with the ribbon. I guess I wrote it but forgot to post.  Typical.<br/> <br/>This is a stunning image.  I love the grain, the subtle colour, and the mystery.  The echoing shapes in the negative spaces are divine.  Well done indeed.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2014-02-09 07:57:40.</i></td>', '  I thought I did this. I''m sure I left a lovely comment, with the ribbon. I guess I wrote it but forgot to post.  Typical. This is a stunning image.  I love the grain, the subtle colour, and the mystery.  The echoing shapes in the negative spaces are divine.  Well done indeed.', '2014-02-09 07:57:06.000000', '2014-02-09 07:57:40.000000', 0),
