(7223186, 1100622, 108580, '<td valign="top">Never got a chance to comment on your Springbok SAL DC3 but came back to this today. Stunner. S/S perfect at 1/250th and helps with the clarity on the pan. Processing just wonderful. I prefer a less cold colour but it is true to the genre. 7.</td>', 'Never got a chance to comment on your Springbok SAL DC3 but came back to this today. Stunner. S/S perfect at 1/250th and helps with the clarity on the pan. Processing just wonderful. I prefer a less cold colour but it is true to the genre. 7.', '2014-06-01 07:49:43.000000', NULL, 0),
